  m_Name: IntimidatorMediumRobot
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Eldoria::Eldoria.Units.UnitTemplate
  displayName: Intimidator Medium Robot
  role: 2
  description: 'A gorilla-like Rask war robot that knuckle-walks into battle with
    a machine gun on each shoulder. Its Twin Intimidator Machine Guns pour out 10
    shots a volley (5 damage, penetration 1, 20 m), and its Stabilizers let it fire
    them even after moving 30 m. With 10 health and Armor Level 3 it shrugs off rifles
    and pistols, but anti-tank weapons will bring it down. Mechanical: it can''t
    sprint. Heavy Support, so you can field more than one.'
